Title: WebSocket Rules
Status: CANONICAL

- STOMP 1.2 over native WSS; no SSE, no SockJS, no permessage-deflate. (ADR-0003/0004, R42)
- Client -> `/app/v1/commands/**`, `/app/v1/queries/**`.
- Server -> exactly `/user/exchange/amq.direct/sergiotr.v1.control`, `/user/exchange/amq.direct/sergiotr.v1.events` and `/user/exchange/amq.direct/sergiotr.v1.artifacts`.
- No fourth replies destination. Default Origin host is `sergiotr.home.arpa`.
- Client ACK is session flow-control. PostgreSQL is the replay authority.
- Contract-first; no handler without AsyncAPI/JSON Schema.

